From: aignis <6974796+aignis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:19:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] ctr-web data and defaults: PAL VRAM layout, boot to menu,
 widescreen, XA voice language, unlock all, ctr-native.ini

Brings ctr-web's changes to the ctrpad base, behind options that keep the
retail behaviour by default:
- CTR_SWAPCHAIN_Y (0x128; 0xEC for data converted from the PAL disc)
- CTR_SKIP_INTRO (boot straight into the main menu)
- g_cfg_widescreen (16:9 projection squeeze and culling, 16:9 presentation)
- XA voice language for XNF and voice folders, with ENG fallback
- g_cfg_unlockAll in the main menu
- XA music and TEST.STR optional for ctr-web data
Switch 2 enables them through CTR_SWITCH2_CTR_WEB_ASSETS/SKIP_INTRO and reads
widescreen, internal_scale, bilinear, voices and unlock_all from ctr-native.ini.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
